          "text": "Today, PES Secretary General @giacomofilibeck and PES Deputy Secretary General @yonnecpolet attended Lionel Jospin's funeral in Paris.\nTogether, we bid farewell to Jospin, a true social democrat, committed European, and lifelong advocate for justice, equality, and solidarity. \nHis vision, legacy and integrity will continue to inspire our movement. \nOur thoughts are with his loved ones and comrades in France."
